## 6. Non-functional requirements
- Offline-first: entries, photos and checkpoint scans are saved on the device and synced when the signal returns. Sync must never create duplicate or lost entries. Show sync status to the user.
- Works on low-end Android phones and on low/expensive mobile data: compress images and keep GPS use battery-friendly.
- Languages: English and Swahili.
- Security: encrypted data in transit and at rest, role-based access, session timeout, full audit log.
- Compliance: Kenya Data Protection Act 2019. Show a staff consent screen for location tracking. Track location only during an active shift or patrol. Make data retention periods configurable.
- Timezone: Africa/Nairobi (EAT). Store timestamps in UTC and display them in EAT.
- Daily automated backups.
- Branding: LEAFY KEYS name and logo [FILL IN brand colours].

